    {
      "id": "claim_7a9aa7ab61d84058ade3383c4cf1092f",
      "statement": "The documented cPanel deployment procedure is: create the MySQL database with ALL PRIVILEGES, create a Setup Python App with Python 3.10, application root statistik_umat, startup file passenger_wsgi.py and entry point application, upload the project (excluding .venv and node_modules, including the built app/static), pip install -r requirements.txt into the cPanel virtualenv, set DATABASE_URL to mysql+pymysql and a production SECRET_KEY in .env, run alembic upgrade head, then restart the app from Setup Python App.",
